			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761170101,
					"content": "…嗯，这份委托完成得确实没有问题。感谢您的努力，雅珂达小姐，请您收下这份报酬吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170102,
					"content": "哎呀，我都说了不会有问题…嘿嘿，钱还不少呢。还有什么能赚的委托，再帮我找找呗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170103,
					"content": "好的，请您稍等…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170104,
					"content": "…欸？这是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170105,
					"content": "喂，凯瑟琳，那首饰是用来发布悬赏委托的么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170106,
					"content": "您的直觉很准，没错，这的确是伊赫安提先生押在协会，用来发布悬赏委托的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170107,
					"content": "这份委托我接了，情报什么的拿来吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170108,
					"content": "可是，这份委托的酬金并不算多，而且这枚首饰如今在市场上也不值多少钱，可能不符合雅珂达小姐您的需求。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170109,
					"content": "没事，拿来拿来，这份委托就算我好心做慈善了，偶尔也要积积德嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170110,
					"content": "哈哈…哈…好的，请您稍等一下…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170111,
						761170112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170111,
					"content": "又在接委托？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761170113,
					"content": "反正我平时也没别的事，总不能老是呆在屋里摸阿舍鲁吧，那样的话奈姐…呃，老板不得把我赶出来？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170114,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，派蒙，既然你们身手这么好，不然帮我来做委托？到时候钱平分。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170115,
					"content": "#委、委托啊…你问{NICKNAME}，{M#他}{F#她}对这个最在行了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170116,
						761170117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170116,
					"content": "派蒙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170118
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761170118,
					"content": "肯定不是什么大事，我可是很了解伊赫安提那家伙的，他胆子小得很，委托不了什么大事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170119,
					"content": "雅珂达小姐，这是伊赫安提先生所发布的委托详情，请您看看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170120,
					"content": "让我看看，这胆小鬼发布了什么…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170121,
					"content": "…嘁。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170122,
					"content": "怎么了？是很难的委托吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170123,
					"content": "没有。就是没想到，之前连杀鸡都不敢亲自下手的伊赫安提，居然也能发布要人命的委托了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170124,
						761170125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170124,
					"content": "要、要人命？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170126
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761170126,
					"content": "你？哈哈哈哈哈，看得出来，守法得很啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170127,
					"content": "放心，我就是开个玩笑。委托里只写了，需要从一群盗贼手里取回来一点东西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170128,
					"content": "做贼的嘛，钱就是命，命就是钱。这可不就是「要人命」的委托？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170129,
					"content": "跟我走吧，那群毛贼我有办法对付，说不定都不用你出手呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170125,
					"content": "先说好，我很守法的啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170126
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761170117,
					"content": "行吧，看看是什么委托？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170118
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761170112,
					"content": "真是够忙的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170113
					]
				}
			]
		},
