			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761170301,
					"content": "我认输，停手，停手。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡列瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170303,
					"content": "早这样，哪来的这么多事，钱拿着，找个靠谱医生吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170304,
					"content": "…你什么意思？可怜我？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡列瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170305,
					"content": "别废话，钱拿着。之后是把它丢水里，还是用这些钱雇人来揍我，都随你的便。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170306,
					"content": "挨饿和浑身痛的滋味都不好受，别给自己找不痛快，卡列瓦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170307,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡列瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170308,
					"content": "从那个病秧子手上拿的东西，我放在旁边了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡列瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170309,
					"content": "里面除了零钱之外，就只有一张画，一个破娃娃。钱我花完了，其他东西还没来得及丢，都在那边了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡列瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170310,
					"content": "好。最后一个问题，你刚才说伊赫安提是「病秧子」，什么意思？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170311,
					"content": "就是字面意思，他病得都快没人样了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡列瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170312,
					"content": "我看见这家伙的时候，他趴在地上一动不动，我还以为他…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡列瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170313,
					"content": "…然后，我就把他身边的包捡走了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡列瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170314,
					"content": "把你最后一次看见伊赫安提的位置标记给我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170315,
					"content": "最后一次？我想想…应该就在这里…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡列瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170316,
					"content": "#我知道了。{NICKNAME}，派蒙，我们走吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170317,
					"content": "我得把拿回来的东西，当面还给委托人才行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				}
			]
		},
